@prefix res: <https://w3id.org/resonatus#> .
@prefix ex: <https://example.org/resonatus/reasoner/> .

# R17. Using res:hasPropagationEvent on an otherwise-untyped individual. Domain axiom types ex:stray as
# res:ContinuationPath (intended: witnesses belong to paths). It must NOT be typed res:ResonatusCandidate or
# res:Resonatus from this alone (candidate typing requires res:hasTracePath).
ex:pe a res:PropagationEvent .
ex:stray res:hasPropagationEvent ex:pe .
